    ========================================================================
    
    Placeholder Syntax:
    - ${aws-secretsmanager:secret-name}           - Retrieves entire secret as string
    - ${aws-secretsmanager:secret-name/key}       - Retrieves specific key from JSON secret
    
    Examples:
    -->

